{"content":"\n<p>அந்தமான் சிறைச்சாலையில் சித்திரவதை செய்யப்பட்டு உயிரிழந்த தியாகிகள் பெயர் பட்டியல். இதில் ஆர்.எஸ்.எஸ் காரன் ஒருவனும் கிடையாது.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><br />None of the RSS martyrs were tortured to death in the Andaman prison</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><ul><li><figure><img width=\"540\" height=\"960\" src=\"http://penakkal.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/117842516_160564535692338_3301783149807926250_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure></li><li><figure><img width=\"540\" height=\"960\" src=\"http://penakkal.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/117261012_160564789025646_9054980835182156721_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure></li><li><figure><img width=\"540\" height=\"960\" src=\"http://penakkal.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/117324115_160564752358983_2081245305459602484_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure></li><li><figure><img width=\"540\" height=\"960\" src=\"http://penakkal.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/117337533_160565062358952_7416174154409845729_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure></li><li><figure><img width=\"540\" height=\"960\" src=\"http://penakkal.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/117340140_160564909025634_7020508422085322068_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure></li><li><figure><img width=\"540\" height=\"960\" src=\"http://penakkal.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/117387027_160564885692303_896781610605054694_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure></li><li><figure><img width=\"540\" height=\"960\" src=\"http://penakkal.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/117390319_160565079025617_6867404118630461571_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure></li><li><figure><img width=\"540\" height=\"960\" src=\"http://penakkal.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/117391985_160565169025608_5987169085813275987_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></figure></li><li><figure><img width=\"540\" height=\"960\" src=\"http://penakkal.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/117444588_160564855692306_5501472688119861675_n.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></fi